    <item>
      <title>当效率成为负担：Kimi K3与AI时代的“杰文斯悖论”新解</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/kimi-k3ai-20260721094004541-3/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 09:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
